<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
	A battlefield of the Conquest event (ConquestMapData). Written by the Conquest map page (//conquest): edits by hand are kept, comments are not.
	map      id (the file name), name (shown to the players), enabled (the event picks one of the enabled maps by chance), maxPlayers (per team)
	area     the battlefield, minX/minY (north-west corner) to maxX/maxY (south-east corner); z: the ground's height, where it has several layers
	team     blue or red, with its spawn points: x, y, z, heading, radius (how far around the point a wave is spread)
	capture  a capture point: name (A, B...), x, y, z, radius (how close a player must stand to capture it)
	door     a door of data/Doors.xml the event opens (open="true") or closes (open="false") when it starts; doors not named are left as they are
-->
<map id="field_of_whispers" name="Field of Whispers" enabled="true" maxPlayers="250">
	<description>Innadril. A wide open bowl ringed by cliffs, 24000 x 20000. Mirrored west/east: each team has two home flags 6000 from its base (A/B blue side, D/E red side) and C in the middle, 10000 from both bases. The rock hill south-west of C is the only big cover; a dungeon well lies 1000 north-west of A.</description>
